  m_Name: WheelOfFortuneReverseCard
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::Card
  Name: Wheel Of Fortune Reversed
  text: "The card spins wildly in your hand, tilting and turning with unpredictable
    force.  $Fate shifts abruptly, indifferent to your intentions, and the currents
    of the kingdom swirl out of control.  $The princess remains distant, the guard
    bound by duty, the Jester poised to act\u2014but none yield their truths to you
    yet.  $The Wheel of Fortune Reversed warns that destiny can turn against you
    as easily as it favors you.  $Every moment of hesitation or misstep may carry
    unforeseen consequences."
  sprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 3eac8db87f7fae277ae1fbe0b0f8de35, type: 3}
